<p>
God of Hope,
</p>

<p>
Advent begins with<br>
a single, small flame<br>
on a solitary candle,<br>
a gentle promise<br>
that We are not alone.
</p>

<p>
Here is our hope,<br>
the darkness will pass,<br>
for the light is coming.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


